          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காவல்துறை — kāvaltuṟai — \"the police\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "திருடனைப் பிடிப்பது காவல்துறையைப் பொறுத்தது. tiruṭaṉaip piṭippatu kāvaltuṟaiyaip poṟuttatu. Catching the thief depends on the police."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its officers are காவல்துறையினர்; they work from a காவல் நிலையம், a police station."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "காவல்துறை (kāvaltuṟai) is a Tamil compound built from காவல், \"guarding, protection\" (DEDR 1416), and துறை, \"place, branch, department\" (DEDR 3370)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
